-- Tests for Chuong II, Muc 2 (Dieu 33-42). Expected values from the cited lines.

§ `Tests: Chuong II, Muc 2`

§§ `Persons used in these tests`

`an ordinary adult` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`a minor` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS TRUE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`an adult without capacity` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS TRUE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`an adult with difficulty in cognition` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS TRUE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS FALSE
`an adult with limited capacity` MEANS `A person` WITH
    `is an organisation` IS FALSE
    `is a minor` IS FALSE
    `has lost civil act capacity` IS FALSE
    `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` IS FALSE
    `has limited civil act capacity` IS TRUE

§§ `Dieu 33`

-- src:744 | 1. Đối tượng bảo hiểm của hợp đồng bảo hiểm nhân thọ là tuổi thọ, tính mạng
-- src:745 | con người.
-- src:746 | 2. Đối tượng bảo hiểm của hợp đồng bảo hiểm sức khỏe là sức khỏe con người.
#ASSERT `Dieu 33: the object of insurance of a life or health contract` `a life insurance contract` EQUALS `the life span and the life of a human being`
#ASSERT `Dieu 33: the object of insurance of a life or health contract` `a health insurance contract` EQUALS `the health of a human being`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 33: the object of insurance of a life or health contract` `a property insurance contract`

§§ `Dieu 34`

-- src:749 | 1. Bên mua bảo hiểm có quyền lợi có thể được bảo hiểm đối với những người
-- src:750 | sau đây:
-- src:751 | a) Bản thân bên mua bảo hiểm;
-- src:752 | b) Vợ, chồng, cha, mẹ, con của bên mua bảo hiểm;
-- src:753 | c) Anh ruột, chị ruột, em ruột hoặc người khác có quan hệ nuôi dưỡng, cấp
-- src:754 | dưỡng với bên mua bảo hiểm;
-- src:755 | d) Người có quyền lợi về tài chính hoặc quan hệ lao động với bên mua bảo hiểm;
-- src:756 | đ) Người được bảo hiểm đồng ý bằng văn bản cho bên mua bảo hiểm mua bảo
-- src:757 | hiểm sức khỏe cho mình.
-- src:758 | 2. Tại thời điểm giao kết hợp đồng bảo hiểm, bên mua bảo hiểm phải có quyền
-- src:759 | lợi có thể được bảo hiểm.
@ref Dieu 34 (src:749-759)
`the policyholder insures themself` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS TRUE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS FALSE
`the policyholder insures a spouse` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS TRUE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS FALSE
`the policyholder insures a full sibling` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS FALSE
`the policyholder insures an employee` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS TRUE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS FALSE
`the policyholder insures a stranger who consented in writing` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS TRUE
`the policyholder insures a stranger` MEANS `The policyholder's relation to the insured person` WITH
    `is the policyholder themself` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's spouse, parent or child` IS FALSE
    `is the policyholder's full sibling or in a relation of fostering or maintenance with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `has a financial interest or an employment relationship with the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `agreed in writing to the policyholder buying health insurance for them` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures themself`
#ASSERT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures a spouse`
#ASSERT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures a full sibling`
#ASSERT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures an employee`
#ASSERT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures a stranger who consented in writing`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 34: the policyholder has an insurable interest in the insured person` `the policyholder insures a stranger`

§§ `Dieu 35`

-- src:760 | Điều 35. Thời gian cân nhắc tham gia bảo hiểm
-- src:761 | Đối với các hợp đồng bảo hiểm có thời hạn trên 01 năm, trong thời hạn 21
-- src:762 | ngày kể từ ngày nhận được hợp đồng bảo hiểm, bên mua bảo hiểm có quyền từ
-- src:763 | chối tiếp tục tham gia bảo hiểm. Trường hợp bên mua bảo hiểm từ chối tiếp tục
-- src:764 | tham gia bảo hiểm thì hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ bị hủy bỏ, bên mua bảo hiểm được
-- src:765 | hoàn lại phí bảo hiểm đã đóng sau khi trừ đi chi phí hợp lý (nếu có) theo thỏa
-- src:766 | CÔNG BÁO/Số 575 + 576/Ngày 17-7-2022 27
-- src:768 | thuận trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm; doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm không phải bồi thường, trả
-- src:769 | tiền bảo hiểm khi xảy ra sự kiện bảo hiểm.
@ref Dieu 35 (src:760-769)
`a one-year contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a life insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `insured person` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2025 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2026 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a contract one day over a year` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a life insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `insured person` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2025 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2026 1 2
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a ten-year property contract` MEANS `A contract of insurance` WITH
    `class of contract` IS `a property insurance contract`
    `insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `policyholder` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `insured person` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `is a group contract` IS FALSE
    `is a maritime insurance contract` IS FALSE
    `date the contract was made` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `first day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2025 1 1
    `last day of the insurance term` IS YMD 2035 1 1
    `sum insured` IS 0
`a refusal on day 21` MEANS `A decision to withdraw` WITH
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `date the policyholder refused to continue` IS YMD 2025 2 22
    `premium paid` IS 10_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 1_000_000
`a refusal on day 22` MEANS `A decision to withdraw` WITH
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `date the policyholder refused to continue` IS YMD 2025 2 23
    `premium paid` IS 10_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 1_000_000
`a refusal on the day of receipt` MEANS `A decision to withdraw` WITH
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `date the policyholder refused to continue` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `premium paid` IS 10_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 0
`a refusal before receipt` MEANS `A decision to withdraw` WITH
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `date the policyholder refused to continue` IS YMD 2025 1 31
    `premium paid` IS 10_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 0
`a refusal with costs above the premium` MEANS `A decision to withdraw` WITH
    `date the policyholder received the contract` IS YMD 2025 2 1
    `date the policyholder refused to continue` IS YMD 2025 2 5
    `premium paid` IS 10_000_000
    `reasonable costs the contract allows to be deducted` IS 11_000_000
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 35: the contract has a term of more than one year` `a one-year contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the contract has a term of more than one year` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the last day to refuse to go on` `a refusal on day 21` EQUALS YMD 2025 2 22
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal on day 21` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal on day 22` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal on day 21` `a one-year contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal on the day of receipt` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal before receipt` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the policyholder may refuse to go on` `a refusal on day 21` `a ten-year property contract`
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the premium refunded on refusing to go on` `a refusal on day 21` `a contract one day over a year` EQUALS 9_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 35: the premium refunded on refusing to go on` `a refusal on the day of receipt` `a contract one day over a year` EQUALS 10_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 35: the premium refunded on refusing to go on` `a refusal on day 22` `a contract one day over a year`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 35: the premium refunded on refusing to go on` `a refusal with costs above the premium` `a contract one day over a year`

§§ `Dieu 36`

-- src:771 | Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm cấp bảo hiểm tạm thời cho bên mua bảo hiểm kể từ
-- src:772 | thời điểm nhận được yêu cầu bảo hiểm và phí bảo hiểm tạm tính của bên mua bảo
-- src:773 | hiểm. Thời hạn bảo hiểm, số tiền bảo hiểm, điều kiện bảo hiểm tạm thời do doanh
-- src:774 | nghiệp bảo hiểm và bên mua bảo hiểm thỏa thuận. Bảo hiểm tạm thời kết thúc sau
-- src:775 | khi doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm chấp nhận hoặc từ chối bảo hiểm hoặc trường hợp khác
-- src:776 | theo thỏa thuận.
@ref Dieu 36 (src:771-776)
`interim cover accepted on 10 March` MEANS `Interim cover` WITH
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 10)
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover` IS NOTHING
`interim cover ended earlier by agreement` MEANS `Interim cover` WITH
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 10)
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 5)
`interim cover ended later by agreement` MEANS `Interim cover` WITH
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 10)
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 20)
`interim cover ended by agreement only` MEANS `Interim cover` WITH
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS NOTHING
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover` IS JUST (YMD 2025 3 20)
`interim cover still running` MEANS `Interim cover` WITH
    `date the insurer received the request for insurance and the provisional premium` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the insurer accepted or refused the insurance` IS NOTHING
    `other event the parties agreed ends the cover` IS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover begins` `interim cover accepted on 10 March` EQUALS YMD 2025 3 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover ends` `interim cover accepted on 10 March` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 3 10)
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover ends` `interim cover ended earlier by agreement` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 3 5)
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover ends` `interim cover ended later by agreement` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 3 10)
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover ends` `interim cover ended by agreement only` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2025 3 20)
#ASSERT `Dieu 36: the date interim cover ends` `interim cover still running` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Dieu 37`

