    `the policyholder cannot pay the next instalments` IS FALSE
    `date the grace period began` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the contract was terminated under Dieu 26(1)` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the parties agreed to restore the contract` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the missing premium has been paid` IS FALSE
    `the insurer deducted unpaid premium from the surrender value` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder agreed to the deduction` IS FALSE
    `the insurer sued for the premium` IS TRUE
`nothing done to recover` MEANS `The payment of life insurance premium` WITH
