`an adult who agreed in writing` MEANS `A contract on the death of another` WITH
    `the person agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the writing states the sum insured and the beneficiary` IS TRUE
    `person` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `a parent or guardian agreed in writing` IS FALSE
`an adult who agreed but the writing omits the sum` MEANS `A contract on the death of another` WITH
    `the person agreed in writing` IS TRUE
    `the writing states the sum insured and the beneficiary` IS FALSE
    `person` IS `an ordinary adult`
    `a parent or guardian agreed in writing` IS FALSE
